      <procstep>
        <procdesc> USGS provides:
(1) Participation in working groups charged with developing planetary geologic mapping program plans.
(2) Management and coordination of individual mapping projects.
(3) Oversight and expertise in meeting the requirements of USGS map standards.
(4) Editorial support in map reviews and revisions.
(5) Generation of geologic base maps and databases for map investigators, and
(6) Prepress preparation and printing of maps in the USGS Scientific Investigations Map (SIM) Series.</procdesc>
        <procsv>PostGIS</procsv>
